  "bodyHash": "Q/cr2kHpQ1Q=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"394\" height=\"115\"></a></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新Discord伺服器！提供私人支援與更新通知。</span></h1><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/328/mod-info.png\" alt=\"模組資訊\" width=\"1024\" height=\"107\"></h2><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">只需要這個模組的維度？請下載：</span> <span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pharaohs-legacy-demension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span></h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">別忘了查看我個人資料中的其他模組！</span></h1><h2>歡迎使用（法老遺產）模組</h2><h2>本模組以埃及時代/埃及法老時期為背景。</h2><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西元前3100年</strong></span></h2><h2>這個模組為您的Minecraft伺服器添加了廣闊的沙漠。沉浸在過往的古老時光中！</h2><h1>想要製作傳送門？請查看媒體分頁。</h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/235/portal.png\" alt=\"傳送門\" width=\"1899\" height=\"958\"></p><h1><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">要啟動傳送門，請製作（撒哈拉圖騰）</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/493/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"傳送門鑰匙\" width=\"1012\" height=\"277\"></span></p><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！下載此模組前請備份您的Minecraft伺服器。我們不希望您的大型生態域模組損壞伺服器。</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">請注意：若遇到崩潰或錯誤，請在GitHub的（Issues）中回報</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！同時使用多個生態域模組可能導致此模組被阻擋。</span></h1><h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">我們不會降級模組版本，僅支援（1.20.1及更高版本）</span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線3\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/330/biome.png\" alt=\"音效\" width=\"1024\" height=\"85\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>誰不喜歡寧靜的生態域背景音？我們為生態域添加了真實音效。讓風聲掠過耳畔/鳥鳴環繞。</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線4\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/331/skywater.png\" alt=\"音效與水體\" width=\"1024\" height=\"93\"></p><h2>水體與天空的顏色將還原真實埃及的色調！</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線5\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/335/structure.png\" alt=\"建築結構\" width=\"1024\" height=\"149\"></p><h2>我們在生態域中添加了多種建築。神廟、獅身人面像、小型金字塔等！請查看圖片以獲得更多細節。</h2><p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/647/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"主要建築\" width=\"1837\" height=\"1282\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/644/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"神廟\" width=\"2158\" height=\"1091\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/643/minecraft_neoforge__1-21-4_-_singleplayer_15-2.png\" alt=\"獅身人面像\" width=\"2054\" height=\"1148\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">此生態域中會生成多種Minecraft建築結構。森林府邸、金字塔、村莊等。</span></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></p><p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/324/kagud6s.png\" alt=\"curseforge\" width=\"280\" height=\"280\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/322/90zvx3m.png\" alt=\"neoforge\" width=\"278\" height=\"278\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/323/636829723898798601.png\" alt=\"fabric\" width=\"239\" height=\"239\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/329/szhld8n.jpg\" alt=\"快逃！\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模組使用以下工具開發：intellij</span></h1><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"Intell\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></p>",
